{"v":4,"catch":"在三屏榮耀中品嚐“tuna sashimi”！","desc":"《Darius II》是 Taito 於 1989 年推出的一款射擊遊戲。\n駕駛強大的改裝銀鷹穿過從太陽到水星、金星、月球、地球、火星，然後到木星的各個階段，在途中與各種頭目作戰以拯救你的人民，\n這是令人印象深刻的 3 屏幕版本！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-10-05","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/05c1b61c2c0a02008cb4516bbbf0957ed7dac6a098273d8bf9b52623dff1f7df.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aa1e127dfdcb1e2ef359be1dde2f91504012f2d6b229b9e2ae1b9d32a942d3a2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a45bd0adf9cb78ac06cf0bb7a049d1c873d2e7b1e7bf0da1a0bdbce5fe7acad9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/927759c4ad9437f822c09195ac6423654cb43dddc878f48bb6571e550f7201a7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7dff65c479f3c4ab62e0ba485f1440069b578e9a12f6d0aa9947595c7b8d89f3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/de6554cff9ff56b161d3c2c712e0c43ae26ef6b5dae2507c73591cf46769bd79.jpg"],"titleId":"0100fae01af9e000","dlc":[]}